{"4525640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Boxing Life Simulator", "steam_appid": 4525640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4798510], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rise from the Grind to Glory!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of an aspiring fighter in <strong>Boxing Life Simulator</strong>, where every decision you make outside the ring is just as important as every punch you throw inside it. This is more than a sports game; it’s a journey of discipline, management, and ultimate triumph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525640/extras/8a259df7b3f07119bc8c55668e1c3612.poster.avif?t=1788288851\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525640/extras/8a259df7b3f07119bc8c55668e1c3612.webm?t=1788288851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525640/extras/8a259df7b3f07119bc8c55668e1c3612.mp4?t=1788288851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Master the Art of Fighting</strong> Step into the ring and face a diverse roster of opponents. Each victory brings you closer to the championship, but winning requires more than just luck. You must learn your opponent's patterns, manage your stamina, and execute precise combinations to secure a knockout.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525640/extras/819e33560b1707f7334992874de3f247.poster.avif?t=1788288851\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525640/extras/819e33560b1707f7334992874de3f247.webm?t=1788288851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525640/extras/819e33560b1707f7334992874de3f247.mp4?t=1788288851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Grind Never Stops: Gym &amp; Nutrition</strong> Your performance in the ring is a direct reflection of your lifestyle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gym:</strong> Spend your hard-earned winnings on gym memberships. Engage in rigorous training sessions to improve your core stats: Strength, Speed, and Stamina.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nutrition Matters:</strong> Your body is your weapon. Consume the right foods to fuel your recovery and maintain peak physical condition.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Condition Management:</strong> Neglecting your routine has consequences. If you fail to balance your diet and training, your condition will deteriorate, making even the simplest matches a struggle for survival.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525640/extras/28c0a2abe055c6a818d37f60d43f2f3c.poster.avif?t=1788288851\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525640/extras/28c0a2abe055c6a818d37f60d43f2f3c.webm?t=1788288851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525640/extras/28c0a2abe055c6a818d37f60d43f2f3c.mp4?t=1788288851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Legacy Beyond the Ring</strong> A true champion knows that life is about more than just fighting. As your fame grows, so do your opportunities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lifestyle &amp; Success:</strong> Move out of the basement and into luxury. Purchase new houses and upgrade your living standards to reflect your status as a world-class boxer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Relationships:</strong> Navigate the social side of a professional athlete's life. Manage relationships that can influence your career and mental well-being.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economic Strategy:</strong> Balance your bank account. Decide whether to invest in better training gear or save up for that dream mansion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have the discipline to create a routine, stay strong, and become the greatest of all time? The ring is waiting.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rise from the Grind to Glory!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of an aspiring fighter in <strong>Boxing Life Simulator</strong>, where every decision you make outside the ring is just as important as every punch you throw inside it. This is more than a sports game; it’s a journey of discipline, management, and ultimate triumph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525640/extras/8a259df7b3f07119bc8c55668e1c3612.poster.avif?t=1788288851\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525640/extras/8a259df7b3f07119bc8c55668e1c3612.webm?t=1788288851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525640/extras/8a259df7b3f07119bc8c55668e1c3612.mp4?t=1788288851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Master the Art of Fighting</strong> Step into the ring and face a diverse roster of opponents. Each victory brings you closer to the championship, but winning requires more than just luck. You must learn your opponent's patterns, manage your stamina, and execute precise combinations to secure a knockout.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525640/extras/819e33560b1707f7334992874de3f247.poster.avif?t=1788288851\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525640/extras/819e33560b1707f7334992874de3f247.webm?t=1788288851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525640/extras/819e33560b1707f7334992874de3f247.mp4?t=1788288851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Grind Never Stops: Gym &amp; Nutrition</strong> Your performance in the ring is a direct reflection of your lifestyle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gym:</strong> Spend your hard-earned winnings on gym memberships. Engage in rigorous training sessions to improve your core stats: Strength, Speed, and Stamina.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nutrition Matters:</strong> Your body is your weapon. Consume the right foods to fuel your recovery and maintain peak physical condition.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Condition Management:</strong> Neglecting your routine has consequences. If you fail to balance your diet and training, your condition will deteriorate, making even the simplest matches a struggle for survival.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525640/extras/28c0a2abe055c6a818d37f60d43f2f3c.poster.avif?t=1788288851\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525640/extras/28c0a2abe055c6a818d37f60d43f2f3c.webm?t=1788288851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525640/extras/28c0a2abe055c6a818d37f60d43f2f3c.mp4?t=1788288851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Legacy Beyond the Ring</strong> A true champion knows that life is about more than just fighting. As your fame grows, so do your opportunities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lifestyle &amp; Success:</strong> Move out of the basement and into luxury. Purchase new houses and upgrade your living standards to reflect your status as a world-class boxer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Relationships:</strong> Navigate the social side of a professional athlete's life. Manage relationships that can influence your career and mental well-being.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economic Strategy:</strong> Balance your bank account. Decide whether to invest in better training gear or save up for that dream mansion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have the discipline to create a routine, stay strong, and become the greatest of all time? The ring is waiting.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Boxing Life Simulator is a simulator game which combined with boxing mechanics. You can fight with your opponents on tournaments, you can have a social life, you can make money and spend it to improve your power and your social life statues.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Bulgarian, Danish, Indonesian, Dutch, Finnish, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Hungarian, Malay, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Greek, Czech, Swedish, Albanian, Azerbaijani, Bosnian, Estonian, Filipino, Croatian, Latvian, Lithuanian, Macedonian, Maltese, Slovak, Slovenian, Sorani, Irish, Scots, Icelandic", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525640/91566a1